        <activityName xml:lang="en">Water supply network</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Water supply network
About 712 Mio m3 per year are transported in the Swiss water supply network. Life time 70 years.;
UUID: 83e88ab5-0a07-3a06-b975-c1bcf39cccae
Materials, transports, disposal for the infrastructure. Estimation for building process. No land use for construction work.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Supply network for drinking water.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: 16040km are in use in CH. 
Sampling: Literature and own estimations 
Extrapolations: From single data to Swiss situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_83e88ab5-0a07-3a06-b975-c1bcf39cccae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
